# Independent C-b consolidated readiness review

Verdict: **PASS for preparing C-c's concrete fresh campaign proposal.** No source or evidence blocker was found within this consolidation scope. This is not execution approval, a successful-campaign verdict, or whole-branch acceptance.

## Finding

**Resolved P2 — Entry-count wording corrected.** The initial report incorrectly described the available entry counts as nonzero. The inspected `production_runtime.py:651–654` includes present allowlisted counts even when zero; only the subsequent cumulative rejection count is omitted at zero. The principal corrected the report to distinguish available closed-allowlist counts from zero-rejection omission, including the dynamic-coverage limitation. I confirmed the correction. Source and evidence remain unchanged. No actionable consolidated finding remains.

