The readiness identity table matches the fixed-authority evidence. Eleven path-bound identities, including the original actual06 manifest, data bundle, prices provenance, profiles, source/policy, baseline and parent provenance, also match the complete saved actual06 map. The fixed authority remains evaluator `005064e57e80...`, image `4e85b19aa8c1...`, profile `0923e93f56e0...`, development bundle `cf729b47d762...`, source bundle `109a61992ac7...`, and parent revision `5d2a95ba2572...`. Its recorded 16-edge authentication and original four discovery request/output bindings are supplied evidence, not authentications rerun by this reviewer.

